# MCMC Analysis: PSP vs ΛCDM

This repository contains the complete MCMC analysis comparing the Phase-State Parameter (PSP) cosmological model with the standard ΛCDM model.

## Results Summary

| Model | χ² | AIC | BIC |
|-------|-----|-----|-----|
| ΛCDM  | 153,699.86 | 153,701.86 | 153,710.31 |
| PSP   | **93,796.77** | **93,800.77** | **93,817.66** |

**Δχ² = 59,903.09 in favor of PSP**

